### List support tickets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/support-tickets?page=1&limit=10

### Search support tickets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/support-tickets?q=Payment

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/support-tickets/support-tickets-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/support-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Seat not allotted",
  "customer": "Diya Patel",
  "priority": "medium",
  "status": "pending"
}
